{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32229","headline":"春暮宴罢寄宋寿先辈 · 温庭筠","name":"春暮宴罢寄宋寿先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斜掩朱门花外钟，晓莺时节好相逢。\n窗间桃蘂宿粧在，雨後牡丹春睡浓。\n苏小风姿迷下蔡，马卿才调似临邛。\n谁怜芳草生三径，参佐桥西陆士龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}